<title>ESTONIA: KULMHOONE TO REVISE 1997 PROFIT FORECAST.</title>
<headline>KULMHOONE TO REVISE 1997 PROFIT FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Kulmhoone, a cold storage warehouse, will release its 1997 first half-year financial results and revised 1997 profit forecast on Friday, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said that the board approved a decision to release the data.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202  reuters@reuters.ee</p>
